sender alice basic
sender bob pro
sender cora bulk
recipient rx
recipient ny tz=-05:00
recipient tokyo tz=+09:00
recipient la tz=-08:00
set-for la quiet.start 20:00
set-for la quiet.end 08:00
set-for la limit.daily 2
send w1 alice la one
send w2 alice la two
send w3 alice la ttl=2d three
advance 30s
at d0 16:00
at d0 16:00:10
at d1 16:00:10
stats
report daily la
